  Copyright 2026 Levi Pereira
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Note: building and running this plugin requires the NVIDIA DeepStream SDK (it
includes SDK headers and links DeepStream libraries at runtime). Apache-2.0
covers this plugin's source; the DeepStream SDK itself remains governed by the
NVIDIA agreement below.

